# Build-context allowlist for the worker image (DPES-819 AC2).
# The reusable build workflow sends the repository root as context. Exclude everything first, then
# re-include only what cloud/Dockerfile copies. Later rules win, so the bytecode and env exclusions
# come after the allow rules.
**
!cloud/src/mao_cloud/**
!cloud/toolchain.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
